
# APM dependencies
apm_modules/

# Plain `apm compile` also writes a root AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md. Home Manager
# links every file here into ~, and Pi and Claude Code read these files from
# every parent directory, so tracked copies load the personal guide twice and
# pull dependency CLAUDE.md files into every repo under ~. The guide reaches
# each agent through .codex/AGENTS.md (see docs/guides/pi-agent.md).
/AGENTS.md
/CLAUDE.md
